  offer           0.4888      0.0196     24.93    <0.001   [0.4456, 0.5319]
  distance       -0.0061      0.0014     -4.48     0.001   [-0.0090, -0.0031]

partial R² 0.2446
F of the excluded instruments 319.12 on 2 and 11 degrees of freedom (clustered by site)

standard errors: clustered by site (12 clusters, CR1)
weak instruments: Kleibergen–Paap F 319.12 · effective F 378.11 (critical value 20.10)
over-identification: Hansen's J, chi2(1) = 0.65   p = 0.419 (clustered by site)
endogeneity: Durbin–Wu–Hausman F(1, 11) = 15.55   p = 0.002 (clustered by site)
warning[W1002]: few clusters: 12 clusters give clustered errors little to rest on (line 2)
  = help: the wild cluster bootstrap (`se: bootstrap`, release 1.1) is the usual remedy below 30 clusters

